OL,3,GNEWSASEN parents 'frustrated and
OL,4,Aanxious' about school placement offers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lot of pupils will by now have
OL,7,Falready posed for a photo wearing their
OL,8,Fschool uniform, but for many parents
OL,9,Fwith children who have special
OL,10,Feducational needs (SEN), this week will
OL,11,Fnot have been an exciting one.
OL,13,FOne in five pupils in Northern Ireland
OL,14,F- more than 70,000 - have some form of
OL,15,FSEN, and demand for school places
OL,16,Foutstrips capacity.
OL,18,FOne of them, four-year-old Lottie, has
OL,19,Fsevere learning difficulties but could
OL,20,Fnot get a place at a SEN school.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
